  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I mean, given there are loads of step-by-step tutorials for \"hackers\" to bypass EAC and continue their malicious behavior, how do we know if this is even going to work?  What I predict is this:  Within a couple of weeks, malicious users will have found a way to resume their antics, and all the \"pretty much innocent\" QoL mod users will be s.. out of luck.  EAC might seem good in the promotional materials, but EAC is -PROVEN- to be beatable.  At that point, VRC could find itself in the position of malicious modders and the rest of us, who no longer have a chance to defend ourselves, no longer have the level of QoL, and no longer have specific accessibility tools for those who need it.",
